Homepage: https://github.com/soroush75/TanbalType
Description: fixes text typed with the wrong keyboard layout (Persian <-> English)
 TanbalType watches what you type and, when a word was typed with the wrong
 keyboard layout (e.g. "sghl" instead of "سلام"), replaces it with the
 intended word and switches the keyboard layout. Works on X11 and Wayland
 (GNOME, KDE Plasma, Cinnamon, MATE, XFCE, Sway, Hyprland, ...).
 .
 On servers the "tanbaltype convert" command converts text in the terminal.
